---
---

<section id="pilihan-kebutuhan" class="py-6 sm:py-8 bg-[#efebe2] border-b border-[#dedad0] font-sans">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header (Shopify Clean Minimalist) -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-6 sm:mb-8">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#064e3b] uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">
        Pilihan Kebutuhan Pertanian
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#1b2819] tracking-tight mb-2">
        Belanja Material Saprodi atau Bangun Greenhouse Siap Tanam?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#485245] font-normal">
        Kami menyediakan opsi belanja material saja untuk pasang mandiri atau paket pengerjaan turnkey sesuai rencana Anda.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 2 Pathways Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
      
      <!-- Path 1: Butuh Material & Saprodi -->
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-[#f4f1ea] border border-[#dedad0] hover:border-[#c8c3b7] hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-white border border-[#dedad0] text-[#064e3b] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-2xs">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          
          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-[#1b2819] mb-2">
            Saya Membutuhkan Material &amp; Saprodi Saja
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#485245] leading-relaxed mb-5">
            Cocok jika Anda sudah memiliki tim perakit sendiri, ingin menyulam plastik UV lama, atau membutuhkan suplai rutin pupuk, mulsa, dan selang drip.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-2 mb-6">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#1b2819] block mb-2">Material Siap Kirim dari Gudang:</span>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-[#dedad0] text-xs text-[#1b2819] font-medium">Plastik UV 200µm</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-[#dedad0] text-xs text-[#1b2819] font-medium">Paranet 65%-85%</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-[#dedad0] text-xs text-[#1b2819] font-medium">Insect Net 50 Mesh</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-[#dedad0] text-xs text-[#1b2819] font-medium">Spring Clip Lock</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-[#dedad0] text-xs text-[#1b2819] font-medium">Selang Drip 16mm</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-[#dedad0] text-xs text-[#1b2819] font-medium">Pupuk &amp; Nutrisi</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-[#dedad0] text-xs text-[#1b2819] font-medium">Mulsa MPHP</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-[#dedad0] text-xs text-[#1b2819] font-medium">Benih Unggul</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a
          href="/produk/"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full px-5 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#064e3b] hover:bg-[#047857] text-[#edeae1] font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all shadow-xs"
        >
          <span>Buka Katalog Produk &amp; Material</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Path 2: Buat Greenhouse Siap Tanam -->
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-[#f4f1ea] border border-[#dedad0] hover:border-[#c8c3b7] hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-white border border-[#dedad0] text-[#064e3b] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-2xs">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          
          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-[#1b2819] mb-2">
            Saya Ingin Bangun Greenhouse Siap Tanam
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#485245] leading-relaxed mb-5">
            Tim teknisi kami menangani dari konsultasi jenis rangka (bambu, baja ringan, galvanis, tunnel garam), kalkulasi RAB transparan, hingga instalasi selesai siap tanam.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-2 mb-6">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#1b2819] block mb-2">Layanan Kontraktor Meliputi:</span>
            <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-[#485245]">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#064e3b] shrink-0"></span>
                <span>Analisis kondisi angin, orientasi matahari &amp; topografi lahan</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#064e3b] shrink-0"></span>
                <span>Pilihan rangka: Bambu awet, Baja Ringan, Galvanis, Tunnel Garam</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#064e3b] shrink-0"></span>
                <span>Pemasangan atap plastik UV anti-drip &amp; kuncian spring clip</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#064e3b] shrink-0"></span>
                <span>Instalasi fertigasi selang drip tuntas siap produksi panen</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a
          href="/jasa/pembuatan-greenhouse/"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full px-5 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#064e3b] hover:bg-[#047857] text-[#edeae1] font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all shadow-xs"
        >
          <span>Konsultasi Pembuatan Greenhouse</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
